WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.187 --> 00:00:13.667
Smith!" Roxy cried.

2
00:00:13.687 --> 00:00:15.848
"What's wrong with you?"

3
00:00:16.568 --> 00:00:18.048
The detective's eyes were blank.

4
00:00:19.329 --> 00:00:21.009
"I look fabulous!"

5
00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:24.450
Roxy ripped the ugly scarf off the detective.

6
00:00:25.451 --> 00:00:27.471
Detective Smith's eyes returned to normal.

7
00:00:27.491 --> 00:00:30.012
"Wh-what happened to me?"

8
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:35.122
"That scarf was controlling you," the woman said.

9
00:00:35.142 --> 00:00:38.845
"Really?" Detective Smith scratched his head.

10
00:00:38.865 --> 00:00:43.988
"There's something wrong with Viktor's clothes," Roxy said.

11
00:00:44.008 --> 00:00:47.010
"They're controlling mannequins and people.

12
00:00:48.010 --> 00:00:49.671
We need to find Viktor."

13
00:00:50.071 --> 00:00:50.952
She turned to the woman.

14
00:00:50.972 --> 00:00:52.553
"Do you know where he works?"

15
00:00:53.253 --> 00:00:54.034
The woman nodded.

16
00:00:55.435 --> 00:00:56.996
Then she looked up the address for Roxy.

17
00:01:02.632 --> 00:01:04.973
A moment later Roxy arrived at Viktor's studio.

18
00:01:05.853 --> 00:01:07.353
Ugly clothes hung on racks.

19
00:01:08.614 --> 00:01:11.154
A man in an orange hat was drawing a design.

20
00:01:12.275 --> 00:01:14.015
A tape measure was looped around his neck.

21
00:01:15.616 --> 00:01:16.816
"Viktor Velour?"

22
00:01:17.156 --> 00:01:17.876
Roxy asked.

23
00:01:18.896 --> 00:01:19.837
"Yes, that's me."

24
00:01:20.117 --> 00:01:21.557
The man looked up and smiled.

25
00:01:22.497 --> 00:01:23.378
"Rocket Girl!"

26
00:01:25.118 --> 00:01:25.738
He ran over.

27
00:01:25.758 --> 00:01:28.599
"I will design a fabulous costume for you!"

28
00:01:29.599 --> 00:01:31.440
Viktor measured Roxy's arms and waist.

29
00:01:32.232 --> 00:01:33.733
"What colors do you like, hmm?

30
00:01:33.893 --> 00:01:34.733
Do you like stripes?"

31
00:01:35.494 --> 00:01:37.094
He stepped back and rubbed his chin.

32
00:01:37.114 --> 00:01:40.116
"That cape is no good.

33
00:01:40.316 --> 00:01:41.296
I'll design a better one!"

34
00:01:43.337 --> 00:01:45.078
Viktor sat down and started to draw again.

35
00:01:45.098 --> 00:01:50.240
"I'm not here for a new costume," Roxy said.

36
00:01:50.860 --> 00:01:52.001
Viktor put down his pencil.

37
00:01:52.021 --> 00:01:53.141
"You're not?"

38
00:01:53.742 --> 00:01:54.202
He blinked.

39
00:01:54.222 --> 00:01:56.063
"Then why are you here?"

40
00:01:57.483 --> 00:01:58.224
Roxy sighed.

41
00:01:59.712 --> 00:02:03.134
"Your clothes are controlling people—and mannequins."

42
00:02:04.135 --> 00:02:04.835
Viktor nodded.

43
00:02:04.855 --> 00:02:05.956
"Yes, yes.

44
00:02:05.996 --> 00:02:07.497
My clothes are supposed to do that.

45
00:02:08.017 --> 00:02:10.018
I was tired of people laughing at my clothes.

46
00:02:11.119 --> 00:02:12.500
Fashion models said they were ugly.

47
00:02:13.240 --> 00:02:16.282
Now my clothes are made with a special fabric that I created.

48
00:02:16.302 --> 00:02:18.964
The fabric controls people and mannequins."

49
00:02:20.424 --> 00:02:21.205
He tilted his head.

50
00:02:21.225 --> 00:02:22.626
"Is that a problem?"

51
00:02:22.646 --> 00:02:25.187
"Are you serious?"

52
00:02:25.567 --> 00:02:26.248
Roxy asked.

53
00:02:26.840 --> 00:02:30.503
"The mannequins are trying to force everyone to wear your clothes!"

54
00:02:30.523 --> 00:02:33.606
"Everyone should wear my clothes!"

55
00:02:34.766 --> 00:02:35.507
Viktor stood up.

56
00:02:35.527 --> 00:02:38.770
"In fact, I'm going to the big fashion show this afternoon.

57
00:02:39.770 --> 00:02:41.452
I'll make everyone wear my clothes.

58
00:02:42.012 --> 00:02:44.354
Then I'll be the most famous fashion designer ever!"

59
00:02:44.374 --> 00:02:47.977
"I won't let you do that," Roxy said.

60
00:02:49.038 --> 00:02:50.299
Viktor glared at Roxy.

61
00:02:51.300 --> 00:02:53.021
"Mannequins!" he shouted.

62
00:02:54.782 --> 00:02:56.384
Three mannequins rushed into the room.

63
00:02:57.452 --> 00:02:59.013
"Attack Rocket Girl!"

64
00:02:59.453 --> 00:03:00.153
Viktor shouted.

65
00:03:02.193 --> 00:03:03.974
Roxy fired her eye laser beams.

66
00:03:04.494 --> 00:03:07.095
Whiz-hoo! One mannequin exploded.

67
00:03:08.475 --> 00:03:10.196
Two other mannequins grabbed Roxy.

68
00:03:11.076 --> 00:03:14.357
"Grr!" Roxy shook off the mannequins.

69
00:03:14.997 --> 00:03:15.737
One hit the wall.

70
00:03:16.237 --> 00:03:18.358
The other one knocked down a large roll of fabric.

71
00:03:19.158 --> 00:03:21.539
The fabric quickly unrolled, spilling over Roxy.

72
00:03:22.619 --> 00:03:23.699
Her eyes went blank.

73
00:03:24.259 --> 00:03:25.980
She began to feel strange.
